---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'March 15, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ThisGHLGuy"
  description="Privacy Policy for ThisGHLGuy.com — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="/privacy-policy/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4" style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray max-w-none">

      <p>
        ThisGHLGuy.com ("we," "our," or "the site") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit <strong>thisghlguy.com</strong>, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.
      </p>

      <p>
        By using this site, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the site.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Analytics Data (Google Analytics)</h3>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors interact with this site. Google Analytics collects information such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pages you visit and time spent on each page</li>
        <li>Your general geographic location (country/city level)</li>
        <li>Device type, browser, and operating system</li>
        <li>How you arrived at the site (search engine, direct link, referral)</li>
        <li>Interactions with content (scroll depth, clicks)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This data is collected anonymously and aggregated. We cannot identify you personally from analytics data. Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to track this information. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-on</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        This site uses cookies primarily for analytics purposes (see above). Cookies are small text files stored in your browser. We do not use cookies for advertising targeting, user accounts, or any purpose beyond basic site analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Note that disabling cookies may affect how some features of the site function.
      </p>

      <h3>Information You Voluntarily Provide</h3>
      <p>
        This site does not have user accounts, comment sections, or contact forms. We do not actively collect personal information such as your name or email address through the site itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you contact us directly via email, we will retain that correspondence to respond to your inquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Affiliate Links & Third-Party Sites</h2>
      <p>
        ThisGHLGuy.com participates in the <strong>GoHighLevel affiliate program</strong>. When you click an affiliate link on this site (identified by the <code>?fp_ref=thisghlguy</code> parameter), you are redirected to GoHighLevel's website. If you sign up for a GoHighLevel account, we may receive a commission at no extra cost to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        GoHighLevel's handling of your personal information (including your name, email, payment details, and account data) is governed by <a href="https://www.gohighlevel.com/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GoHighLevel's Privacy Policy</a>. We have no access to or control over the data you provide to GoHighLevel.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site may also link to other third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>
        The information collected through Google Analytics is used solely to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand which content is most useful to our readers</li>
        <li>Improve the site's structure, navigation, and performance</li>
        <li>Identify technical issues and fix them</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or share your data with third parties for marketing or advertising purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Google Analytics retains analytics data according to Google's own data retention policies (typically 14 months by default for event-level data). We do not retain any personally identifiable information ourselves.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to access</strong> — Request information about what data we hold about you</li>
        <li><strong>Right to deletion</strong> — Request that your data be deleted</li>
        <li><strong>Right to opt out</strong> — Opt out of analytics tracking via the Google opt-out tool or your browser's cookie controls</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Since this site does not collect personal information directly, most of these rights are exercised through Google's tools. You can manage your Google data at <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/data-and-privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">myaccount.google.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under the age of 13 (or 16 in certain jurisdictions). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information through this site, please contact us and we will take steps to remove it.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of the site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can reach us at:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>ThisGHLGuy.com</strong><br />
        Website: <a href="https://www.thisghlguy.com">thisghlguy.com</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
